config SPRD_MANUFACTURER_MODEL
	tristate "Spreadtrum SoC model / manufacturer strings"
	depends on OF
	help
	  Reads the "soc-module" (SoC model) and "soc-manufacturer"
	  properties from the device tree root node and exposes them as
	  the soc_model / soc_manufacturer sysfs attributes of a private
	  device, e.g. "soc_model: UMS512".

	  Port of the vendor 5.4 `sprd_manufacturer_model.ko`.  The blob
	  initialises a static struct device but never registers it, so
	  the sysfs group is not reachable; the strings are still read
	  from the device tree and printed by the driver at init time.
